data: {"id": "12859b0709204f8f-thinking-parallel_evidence-2553", "run_id": "12859b0709204f8f", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "## 已采集事实\n\n| 维度 | 关键事实 | 与候选原因的关系 |\n|------|---------|-----------------|\n| **K8s Pod describe** | `node: <none>`，`QoS: Burstable`。容器 `app` 请求 `cpu: 5m`，**limit/requests memory: 1Pi**。 | 1Pi 内存限制是极端异常值，直接触发调度器 `Insufficient memory`。 |\n| **Events** | `FailedScheduling: 0/3 nodes are available: 3 Insufficient memory. preemption: 3 No preemption victims found.` | 调度器明确归因为 **3 个节点均内存不足**。无预emption 空间（Pod QoS=Burstable，无更高优先级 Pod 可被驱逐）。 |\n| **Node-Selectors / Affinity / Taints** | `Node-Selectors: <non", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1789109198145, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

